DTSTAMP:20261017T041205Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T234500
SUMMARY:Pool at Rockaway Billiards!
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\n***Much lik
 e last time\, trying something different. Unlike Clifton Billiards\, this 
 place has its own parking lot. They only do $20 day passes\, but it's supe
 r laid back\, we don't have to check in with management to change tables\,
  and we can play as long as we want. This place also lets people bring the
 ir own food and drink\, so if we want to order from a local spot\, bring s
 nacks or beverages\, we are able. If this ends up being too far out for ma
 ny people to join\, I'll do the next one at Clifton Billiards or closer pl
 aces going forward. Just wanted to see how this flew with the group.***\n\
 n\\*\\*\\ *Expectations\\*\\*:*\nPool cues are available at the location\,
  expect mid to low lighting.\n\\*\\ **What if I'm a beginner or only want 
 to play with people at a similar level?\\*\nTables will be divided between
  beginners\, intermediate players\, and advanced. However\, this depends o
 n how many types of players come\, so it will be divided as best as possib
 ly available. If you would like game rules\, please speak with Marc.\\*\\ 
 *Marc is also available to answer questions including how to hold the cue\
 , stances\, etc.\\*\\*\n\n\\*\\*\\* I feel like people aren't trying to be
  my friend.\\*\n\\*Please remember that different people have different go
 als. Some may come to just play billiards\, others may be there to meet ne
 w people or do something social\, and some may be there to make long term 
 friends. Find people that match your goals or be ok with others that may n
 ot.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/316498331/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260910T130230Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260910T130230Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
