SUMMARY:Run Club - Bayonne
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nTrying some
 thing new!\n\nI'm hoping to host a "run club" every few weeks on Sundays n
 ear the Newark Bay in Bayonne.\n\nThinking some workouts and/or casual run
 s on the track and along the waterfront at Stephen R. Gregg Park\, 930 Joh
 n F. Kennedy Boulevard in Bayonne.\n\nFeel free to comment below with your
  ideas and questions.\n\nHope you'll consider joining us or attending one 
 of our bowling\, volleyball\, tennis or other activities -> www.meetup.com
 /north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball
